{"slug":"Universal-Script-VFling-27417","_id":"6791f7529c7bd8961a673d7b","title":"VFling","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"Fling people with vehicles.\n\nHow does this work?\nNetwork Ownership, Find a vehicle, sit on it, grab the path for the seat (e.g: workspace.Car.Seat).\n\nEnter the seat path in the local Seat = variable, Change the Part = variable to the target part you want to fling, and voila!\n\nThis can fling on games even without player collisions, like 2 players cannot touch eachother.\n\nAs most of you already know, I am quitting roblox scripting, this will either be my final or second to final project, This is open source, you may use this in your scripts but please be kind enough to give me credits.","tags":["fling","op","vehicle","opensource"],"script":"-- Vectors:\nlocal V9E9 = Vector3.one * 9e9\nlocal V31 = Vector3.one * 31\n\nlocal Seat = --[[ enter your seat path here, for example: ]]workspace:FindFirstChild(\"Structure\"):FindFirstChild(\"Factory Frenzy\"):FindFirstChild(\"Dock\"):FindFirstChild(\"Crane\"):FindFirstChild(\"Crane\"):FindFirstChild(\"CraneSeat\")\nlocal Part = --[[ enter the target part to fling here, for example: ]]workspace.nothingicy.HumanoidRootPart\n\nlocal Velocity = Instance.new(\"BodyVelocity\")\nVelocity.P = 1e6\nVelocity.MaxForce = Vector3.one * 1e6\nVelocity.Velocity = V9E9\nVelocity.Parent = Seat\n\ngame:GetService(\"RunService\").Heartbeat:Connect(function(deltaTime)\n    Seat.Velocity = V31\n\n    Seat.CFrame = Part.CFrame\nend)","owner":{"_id":"64cb81f82512701e9a163c00","username":"vxsty","verified":true,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/57b01f7cde61e97952d99b0bb7515e77aecd38d63bc30d2bb88ae64dcb16358f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/64cb81f82512701e